WEBVTT

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:00.486
the trolls and the blackmailers.

00:04:00.486 --> 00:04:02.488
And we found that the best way to do this

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:05.408
is to implement a three-week
probation period for new members.

00:04:05.449 --> 00:04:08.536
Anyone joining the community
can engage with limited features

00:04:08.577 --> 00:04:12.123
as we assess their activity and ensure
that accounts haven't been reported

00:04:12.164 --> 00:04:14.583
for violating community guidelines.

00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:16.002
After the probation period,

00:04:16.043 --> 00:04:19.630
a member can submit a request
to have a verified mark on their profile.

00:04:19.672 --> 00:04:21.340
This indicates to other members

00:04:21.382 --> 00:04:25.094
that this profile is safe to admit
to their private groups and events.

00:04:25.094 --> 00:04:27.847
Safety is essential above all else.

00:04:28.222 --> 00:04:30.016
Once safety can be established,